WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.258
Ɓernde wooru. Ɗum ko haala ɓaleejo, ɗum hollitii e aada liyela.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.874
E nder wuro Lyela, koo moye anndi bandiraawo muuɗum. Ɓe fuu ɓe ngi'i ɓe andi koo ɗume dow maako.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.632
Mawɗo debbo mo'o maayi, ɗon cembiɗina nder ceede maako duuɓi ujune fuu.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.216
Nder jemma maajum, ɗerewol ɓadake nder suudu maako.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.954
Nde subaka, Ebéyé heɓii ɓoymaaku. Yimɓe nder gariiri ɗon mooɓta.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.362
Goonɗinɗo go'o ɗon wara. Goɗɗo mo waɗani ɗum heɓii.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.550
Kanko woni! Kanko woni ko o waɗi!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.032
Koo to o haɓɓi, walaa mo nana.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.264
To walaa daliila, a waɗataa goɗɗo hakke.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:44.458
Mawɓe ɗon kawta. Walaa go'oto yi'i kooɗume, nden kam ɓe fuu ɓe ɗon du'ana woɓɓe.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.128
Kamɓe ɓe njokki haala maɓɓe.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.746
Ɓe ɗon njaha haa nokkuure wooɗugo. Walaa ko ɓe mbi'ata dow maajum.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.712
Walaa ko hollata, sey hendu, jayngol e nyiwre.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.704
Wakkati go'o, sukaajo mo ɗon ɗaani.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:02.386
Kanko woni jaɓɓi miliyaar. Hakkiilo e ɓerɗe maako ɗon nyaami mo.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:15.002
Nder jemma o wurtini ceede nden, o hoccani ɗum to hooseere wuro. Ammaa Ebéyé ɗon.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:21.930
Ɗuum woni am. A yaafana yam, mi waawataa ɓeydaago.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:30.534
Mi timmini. Walaa boowal mawɗo.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.258
On mbi'i hoore mon. Ɗuum woni ko wooɗi.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.784
Ngam maajum, ɓe njaafani gooduɗo nyaamdu.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.640
Sey ɓoymaajo maɓɓa gese debbo duɗuɗo.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:10.506
Ɓe ɗon mbi'a wonde wolde. Goonga ɗon anndina yeeso bee ɓaawo.
